# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# analysis/
#
# Ignore everything by default, then re-include only what the repository needs:
#   * the Figure2 / Figure4 / Figure5 build directories -- their notebooks,
#     helper modules and cached plot-ready data (figure_data/)
#   * a short list of standalone analysis notebooks
#
# Rendered figures are never tracked: plots/ is excluded in every figure
# directory, and stray image files are excluded wherever they appear.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*

# --- Supplementary figure notebooks -----------------------------------------
# Same rule as the figure directories: notebooks, helper modules and cached
# plot-ready data, but never the rendered panels.
!SupFigures/
!SupFigures/**
SupFigures/plots/
SupFigures/revision_plots/
SupFigures/**/*.png
SupFigures/**/*.pdf
SupFigures/**/*.svg

# --- Collaborator records ---------------------------------------------------
# Ru's ROSMAP AC/DLPFC/PCC sQTL preprocessing notebooks: the upstream
# provenance for the Figure 5 inputs. SoS notebooks that ran on Columbia
# hardware -- documentation only, not runnable here, not part of the workflow.
# Kept with their stored outputs, so the *.png/*.pdf rules below must not
# reach into this directory (they are scoped to Figure2/4/5 and SupFigures).
!sQTL_data_preprocessing_Ru/
!sQTL_data_preprocessing_Ru/**

# --- Figure build directories ----------------------------------------------
# Un-exclude the directory first, then its contents; git will not descend into
# a directory that is still excluded, so the order matters.
!Figure2/
!Figure4/
!Figure5/
!Figure2/**
!Figure4/**
!Figure5/**

# ...but never the rendered panels themselves.
Figure2/plots/
Figure4/plots/
Figure5/plots/
Figure2/**/*.png
Figure2/**/*.pdf
Figure2/**/*.svg
Figure4/**/*.png
Figure4/**/*.pdf
Figure4/**/*.svg
Figure5/**/*.png
Figure5/**/*.pdf
Figure5/**/*.svg

# --- Standalone analysis notebooks kept in the repository -------------------
!2SLS.ipynb
!GO_analysis.ipynb
!Recursive_Introns.ipynb
!RIN_classification.ipynb
!Supplementary_coloc_examples.ipynb
!UPF3A_confounder.ipynb
!Yang supplementary figures.ipynb
!Zhang2018_recursive_introns_overlap.ipynb

# --- Notebooks that GENERATE inputs for Figures 2/4/5 -----------------------
# Not part of the Snakemake workflow, but the only record of how these files
# were made. See code/code_report.txt.
# GetGTExTables.ipynb  -> code/analysis_files/GTEx.*.tsv.gz     (Fig 2c)
# GetLDmatrices.ipynb  -> code/results/coloc/LD/{locus}.tsv.gz   (Fig 4f)
# NOTE: a '#' only starts a comment at the beginning of a line; a trailing
# '# ...' would become part of the pattern and silently break the negation.
!GetGTExTables.ipynb
!GetLDmatrices.ipynb

# --- workflowr site scaffolding ---------------------------------------------
# This is a workflowr project (_workflowr.yml, analysis/_site.yml, docs/).
# index.Rmd is the site homepage; dropping these breaks wflow_build/wflow_publish.
!index.Rmd
!about.Rmd
!license.Rmd
!_site.yml

# --- Repository metadata ----------------------------------------------------
!.gitignore

# --- Junk that stays ignored even where the rules above would keep it -------
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/__pycache__/
*-checkpoint.ipynb
